    "updated_at": "2025-04-10T08:44:19Z",
    "body": "Latin1 is a pretty bad choice, because on the web it means windows-1252 and on other platforms it means something else. (And the actual spec that defines it leaves its behavior undefined for most bytes.) See also https://github.com/nodejs/node/issues/56542#issuecomment-2594415264 .",
