    "created_at": "2025-04-10T08:49:54Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-10T08:49:54Z",
    "body": "got Latin1/UL1 from \"[Basic Latin](https://unicode.link/blocks/basic-latin)\" and \"[Latin-1 Supplement](https://unicode.link/blocks/latin-1-supplement)\" being the block names for U+0000-00FF",
